/* Outdoor-map (Leaflet) tiles — invert the external tile imagery to dark.
 * invert(1) saturate(0) brightness(2) yields a clean black/grayscale dark map.
 * For a tinted dark map instead of black, adjust the filter
 * (e.g. append hue-rotate(180deg) / sepia() and tune brightness).
 * Satellite imagery (Esri World_Imagery) keeps its own colors. */
